<p>Conjures a furious, raging lightning storm with a radius of 6 that follows you as long as this spell is active.</p><p>Each turn, a random lightning bolt will hit up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> of your foes for 1.00 to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">47, 63, 75, 86, 95</acronym> damage (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">23, 31, 38, 43, 48</acronym> average) in a radius of 1.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>